(7672702, 1253174, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely, subtle and imaginative.  While many of us were looking at tree trunks and clouds, myself included, you found this sublime visual poem far afield from the crowd. <br/>That these birds are wrought from imperfection is a further kiss from the gods of creativity.  The background, serene, painterly and apt, another benediction.  A finely tuned eye at play.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely, subtle and imaginative.  While many of us were looking at tree trunks and clouds, myself included, you found this sublime visual poem far afield from the crowd. That these birds are wrought from imperfection is a further kiss from the gods of creativity.  The background, serene, painterly and apt, another benediction.  A finely tuned eye at play.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2020-08-20 17:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
